SEP-15 and SEP-22 (mesh part): error paths of hmeshOrderNd / meshInduceSepa, proven with malloc fault injection
Build (non-exiting error library): ./common/build_err.sh $INFRA/asan SEP-02/sep02.c SEP-02/sep02_errp ; ./common/build_err.sh $WORK/build SEP-02/sep02.c SEP-02/sep02_err
Scan (single thread so that allocation indices replay):
  export SCOTCH_PTHREAD_NUMBER=1
  ./common/failscan.sh ./SEP-02/sep02_errp 30 2 0 > SEP-15/scan_pristine_sep02.txt   (617 allocations, 184 runs with findings)
  ./common/failscan.sh ./SEP-02/sep02_err  30 2 0 > SEP-15/scan_patched_sep02.txt    (617 allocations, 52 runs with findings)
